{"id":9156,"date":"2020-06-29T00:00:00","date_gmt":"2020-06-29T06:00:00","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/www.rethinkfirst.com\/resources\/returning-to-work-a-conversation-to-resume-regular-operations\/"},"modified":"2025-02-27T17:55:38","modified_gmt":"2025-02-27T22:55:38","slug":"returning-to-work-a-conversation-to-resume-regular-operations","status":"publish","type":"resources","link":"https:\/\/www.rethinkbehavioralhealth.com\/resources\/returning-to-work-a-conversation-to-resume-regular-operations\/","title":{"rendered":"Returning to Work: A Conversation to Resume Regular Operations"},"content":{"rendered":"\t\t<div data-elementor-type=\"wp-post\" data-elementor-id=\"9156\" class=\"elementor elementor-9156\" data-elementor-post-type=\"resources\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<section class=\"elementor-section elementor-top-section elementor-element elementor-element-212105b8 elementor-section-boxed elementor-section-height-default elementor-section-height-default\" data-id=\"212105b8\" data-element_type=\"section\" data-settings=\"{&quot;jet_parallax_layout_list&quot;:[]}\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-container elementor-column-gap-default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-column elementor-col-100 elementor-top-column elementor-element elementor-element-52749ea4\" data-id=\"52749ea4\" data-element_type=\"column\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-wrap elementor-element-populated\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-7ab41260 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"7ab41260\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div id=\"videoDivHolder\"><div><video poster=\"https:\/\/www.rethinkbehavioralhealth.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/10\/485-MzEwNjM4_returning-to-work-conversation-to-resume-regular-operations-june-webinar_thumbnail.jpg\" controls=\"controls\" width=\"300\" height=\"150\"> <source src=\"https:\/\/rtaprodmarketing.blob.core.windows.net\/rta-prod-marketingvideos\/485-MzEwNjM4_returning-to-work-conversation-to-resume-regular-operations-june-webinar.mp4\" type=\"video\/mp4\" \/> <\/video><\/div><\/div><p><style> #videoDivHolder { width: 100%; max-width: 900px; margin: 0 auto; } #videoDivHolder > div { position: relative; overflow: hidden; width: 100%; padding-top: 56.25%; } #videoDivHolder > div video { position: absolute; top: 0; left: 0; bottom: 0; right: 0; width: 100%; height: 100%; } <\/style><\/p><p>Returning to work will bring new legal and practical challenges for employers in all industries and geographies.<\/p><p>For this reason, it is imperative to have a plan in place while being cognizant of laws\/guidelines to avoid any legal repercussions on your company.<\/p><p>Vanessa Kelly, a Labor &amp; Employment Attorney and Litigator with <a href=\"https:\/\/www.clarkhill.com\/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Clark Hill, PLC<\/a>, and Melinda Lapan, Vice President of <a href=\"https:\/\/hr-aa.com\/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">HR Advantage Advisory<\/a>, recently hosted a webinar to help businesses and individuals prepare to resume regular operations.<\/p><p>They discussed the following topics in detail:<\/p><ul><li>Preliminary considerations<\/li><li>Preparing the workplace for safe re-entry<ul><li>OSHA\/CDC guidelines<\/li><li>State Health Authorities<\/li><li>Executive Orders<\/li><\/ul><\/li><li>Hiring\/Rehiring<ul><li>Dealing with Workers\u2019 Anxiety<\/li><li>Refusals to work<\/li><li>Telework, accommodations &amp; leaves<\/li><\/ul><\/li><li>Dealing with workplace exposures or workers who get sick<\/li><li>Takeaways\/Action steps<\/li><li>&amp; more!<\/li><\/ul><h2>About the Presenters<\/h2>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/section>\n\t\t\t\t<section class=\"elementor-section elementor-top-section elementor-element elementor-element-acd2114 authorSection elementor-section-boxed elementor-section-height-default elementor-section-height-default\" data-id=\"acd2114\" data-element_type=\"section\" data-settings=\"{&quot;jet_parallax_layout_list&quot;:[]}\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-container elementor-column-gap-default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-column elementor-col-33 elementor-top-column elementor-element elementor-element-58e767e\" data-id=\"58e767e\" data-element_type=\"column\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-wrap elementor-element-populated\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-7a23e51 elementor-widget elementor-widget-image\" data-id=\"7a23e51\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"image.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img fetchpriority=\"high\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"600\" src=\"https:\/\/www.rethinkbehavioralhealth.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/05\/vanessa-kelly-labor-employment-attorney-member-clark-hill-plc.jpg\" class=\"attachment-full size-full wp-image-18084\" alt=\"Headshot of Vanessa Kelly\" srcset=\"https:\/\/www.rethinkbehavioralhealth.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/05\/vanessa-kelly-labor-employment-attorney-member-clark-hill-plc.jpg 600w, https:\/\/www.rethinkbehavioralhealth.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/05\/vanessa-kelly-labor-employment-attorney-member-clark-hill-plc-300x300.jpg 300w, https:\/\/www.rethinkbehavioralhealth.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/05\/vanessa-kelly-labor-employment-attorney-member-clark-hill-plc-150x150.jpg 150w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 600px) 100vw, 600px\" \/>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-column elementor-col-66 elementor-top-column elementor-element elementor-element-4e28ecd\" data-id=\"4e28ecd\" data-element_type=\"column\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-wrap elementor-element-populated\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-1b12ec5 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"1b12ec5\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<h3>Vanessa Kelly, PLC<\/h3><p><span style=\"color: #333333;\">Labor &amp; Employment Attorney, Member with Clark Hill, PLC,<\/span><\/p><p>Vanessa Kelly is a Labor &amp; Employment Attorney and a Member with <a href=\"https:\/\/www.clarkhill.com\/about\/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Clark Hill, PLC<\/a>, a full-service, global law firm. Vanessa\u2019s clients seek her experienced, confident counsel in addressing their employee management needs. She provides legal services including risk assessment and risk avoidance in employee terminations, accommodating disabilities, addressing workplace misconduct, protecting key personnel and proprietary information, performing reductions in force, and implementation of workplace policies designed to avoid disputes and comply with state and federal law, to name a few.<\/p><p>Vanessa also defends employers before federal and state courts and civil rights agencies. Vanessa earned her J.D. at George Washington University Law School, and is licensed in both NJ and NY.<\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/section>\n\t\t\t\t<section class=\"elementor-section elementor-top-section elementor-element elementor-element-165feef authorSection elementor-section-boxed elementor-section-height-default elementor-section-height-default\" data-id=\"165feef\" data-element_type=\"section\" data-settings=\"{&quot;jet_parallax_layout_list&quot;:[]}\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-container elementor-column-gap-default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-column elementor-col-33 elementor-top-column elementor-element elementor-element-ffac973\" data-id=\"ffac973\" data-element_type=\"column\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-wrap elementor-element-populated\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-17e961f elementor-widget elementor-widget-image\" data-id=\"17e961f\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"image.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"600\" src=\"https:\/\/www.rethinkbehavioralhealth.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/05\/melinda-lapan-vice-president-hr-advantage-advisory.jpg\" class=\"attachment-full size-full wp-image-18085\" alt=\"Headshot of Melinda Lapan\" srcset=\"https:\/\/www.rethinkbehavioralhealth.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/05\/melinda-lapan-vice-president-hr-advantage-advisory.jpg 600w, https:\/\/www.rethinkbehavioralhealth.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/05\/melinda-lapan-vice-president-hr-advantage-advisory-300x300.jpg 300w, https:\/\/www.rethinkbehavioralhealth.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/05\/melinda-lapan-vice-president-hr-advantage-advisory-150x150.jpg 150w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 600px) 100vw, 600px\" \/>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-column elementor-col-66 elementor-top-column elementor-element elementor-element-b3f442b\" data-id=\"b3f442b\" data-element_type=\"column\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-wrap elementor-element-populated\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-4e0dcfd elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"4e0dcfd\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<h3>Melinda Lapan, PLC<\/h3><p><span style=\"color: #333333;\">Vice President of HR Advantage Advisory<\/span><\/p><p>Melinda Lapan is Vice President of <a href=\"https:\/\/hr-aa.com\/about-us\/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">HR Advantage Advisory<\/a>, a subsidiary of Clark Hill. HR Advantage Advisory provides HR outsourcing and consulting services.<\/p><p>Melinda has over 20 years of Generalist experience in Human Resources, having worked in various HR leadership roles across multiple industries prior to joining HR-AA. She has a Master of Business Administration (MBA) degree, she holds two HR certifications and is a <a href=\"https:\/\/www.asq.org\/cert\/six-sigma-green-belt\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Six Sigma Green Belt<\/a>.<\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/section>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t","protected":false},"author":19,"featured_media":15010,"template":"","meta":{"_seopress_robots_primary_cat":"","_seopress_titles_title":"Webinar: Returning to Work - Resume Regular Operations","_seopress_titles_desc":"Returning to work after COVID will bring new legal and practical challenges for employers in all industries and geographies. Have a plan in place.","_seopress_robots_index":"","om_disable_all_campaigns":false,"_links_to":"","_links_to_target":""},"audience":[70],"resource-type":[72],"resource-topic":[69,74],"resource-tag":[],"class_list":["post-9156","resources","type-resources","status-publish","has-post-thumbnail","hentry","audience-providers","resource-type-webinar","resource-topic-business","resource-topic-insurance"],"_links":{"self":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.rethinkbehavioralhealth.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/resources\/9156","targetHints":{"allow":["GET"]}}],"collection":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.rethinkbehavioralhealth.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/resources"}],"about":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.rethinkbehavioralhealth.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/types\/resources"}],"author":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/www.rethinkbehavioralhealth.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/users\/19"}],"version-history":[{"count":0,"href":"https:\/\/www.rethinkbehavioralhealth.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/resources\/9156\/revisions"}],"wp:featuredmedia":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/www.rethinkbehavioralhealth.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/media\/15010"}],"wp:attac